      "path": "LICENSE.md",
      "content": "# Licence: Haven, therapist & counsellor website template\n\nCopyright (c) 2026 CraftMyPage (craftmypage.com). All rights reserved except as set out below.\n\n## Standard licence (included with every purchase)\n\nYou may:\n\n- Use this template to build **one website**, for yourself or for one client.\n- Edit, restyle and extend it however you like.\n- Use it for commercial purposes, including charging a client for the finished site.\n\nYou may not:\n\n- Resell, share, give away or redistribute the template files, edited or unedited, including as part of another template, theme, kit or website builder.\n- Claim the original design as your own work in a template marketplace.\n\n## Agency licence\n\nBuilding sites for several clients? The Agency licence covers **unlimited client websites** for one person or studio. Email hello@craftmypage.com and quote your order number to upgrade for the difference in price.\n\n## Third-party parts\n\n- Fonts load from Google Fonts and are licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (Newsreader, Atkinson Hyperlegible).\n- All icons and illustrations are original to this template and covered by this licence.\n- No photographs are included, so there are no image licences to worry about.\n\n## No warranty\n\nThe template is provided \"as is\". Sample text, including the privacy notice, is a starting point and not legal advice. Check it fits your business before you publish.\n"
