      "content": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\" data-palette=\"ember\" data-mode=\"live\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"utf-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n  <title>Support | Morrow</title>\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"Get help with Morrow: answers to common questions, restoring purchases, deleting your data and contacting the developer.\" />\n  <meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index,follow\" />\n  <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"assets/favicon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" />\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\" />\n  <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin />\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,500;12..96,700;12..96,800&family=Geist:wght@400;500;600&family=Geist+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap\" />\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\" />\n  <script>\n    document.documentElement.classList.add('js');\n    (function () { try { var t = localStorage.getItem('launchpad-theme'); if (t === 'light' || t === 'dark') document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', t); } catch (e) {} })();\n  </script>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <a class=\"skip-link\" href=\"#main\">Skip to content</a>\n  <header class=\"site-header\">\n    <div class=\"container header-inner\">\n      <a class=\"brand\" href=\"index.html\" aria-label=\"Morrow, home\"><span class=\"app-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"sun\"></span></span><span class=\"brand-name\">Morrow</span></a>\n      <div class=\"header-actions\">\n        <button class=\"icon-btn theme-toggle\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Switch to dark theme\" data-theme-toggle>\n          <svg class=\"icon-sun\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"4.2\"/><path d=\"M12 2.5v2M12 19.5v2M2.5 12h2M19.5 12h2M5.3 5.3l1.4 1.4M17.3 17.3l1.4 1.4M5.3 18.7l1.4-1.4M17.3 6.7l1.4-1.4\"/></svg>\n          <svg class=\"icon-moon\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 14.5A8 8 0 0 1 9.5 4a8 8 0 1 0 10.5 10.5Z\"/></svg>\n        </button>\n        <a class=\"btn btn-small\" href=\"index.html#get\">Get Morrow</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n  <main id=\"main\" class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n      <!-- App Store Connect and Google Play both ask for a Support URL. Point them at this page. -->\n      <p class=\"eyebrow mono\">// Support</p>\n      <h1>How can I help?</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead muted\">Morrow is made by one person. I read every message and usually reply within two working days.</p>\n      <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"mailto:support@example.com?subject=Morrow%20support\">Email support@example.com</a></p>\n      <h2>Restore a purchase</h2>\n      <p>Open Morrow, go to <strong>Settings &gt; Morrow Pro</strong> and tap <strong>Restore purchases</strong>. Make sure you&rsquo;re signed in with the same Apple ID or Google account you used to buy it.</p>\n      <h2>Cancel a subscription</h2>\n      <p>Subscriptions are handled by Apple or Google. On iPhone: <strong>Settings &gt; your name &gt; Subscriptions</strong>. On Android: <strong>Google Play &gt; Profile &gt; Payments &amp; subscriptions</strong>.</p>\n      <h2>Delete your data</h2>\n      <p>Everything lives on your device. Deleting the app deletes your plans. If you turned on sync, go to <strong>Settings &gt; Morrow &gt; Delete synced data</strong> first.</p>\n      <h2>Report a bug</h2>\n      <p>Email me with your device model, OS version and Morrow version (shown at the bottom of Settings). A screenshot helps a lot.</p>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <footer class=\"site-footer\">\n    <div class=\"container footer-inner\">\n      <a class=\"brand\" href=\"index.html\" aria-label=\"Morrow, home\"><span class=\"app-icon small\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"sun\"></span></span><span class=\"brand-name\">Morrow</span></a>\n      <nav class=\"footer-links\" aria-label=\"Footer\">\n        <a href=\"support.html\">Support</a>\n        <a href=\"privacy.html\">Privacy policy</a>\n        <a href=\"index.html\">Home</a>\n      </nav>\n      <p class=\"small muted footer-legal\">&copy; <span data-year>2026</span> Morrow Labs.</p>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n  <script src=\"main.js\" defer></script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
